  type: 1
  description: 
  sentences:
    nameNPC: "T\u01B0\u1EDBng Ng\xF4"
    Lines:
    - "S\u01B0\u01A1ng s\u1EDBm ph\u1EE7 tr\u1EAFng chi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1ECBa, im
      l\xECm \u0111\u1EBFn ngh\u1EB9t th\u1EDF. T\u1EEBng ng\u1ECDn c\u1EDD \u0111en
      c\u1EE7a qu\xE2n Ng\xF4 ph\u1EA5p ph\u1EDBi ngo\xE0i c\u1ED5ng, ti\u1EBFng
      gi\xE1p tr\u1EE5 va v\xE0o nhau chan ch\xE1t, h\u1EA3 h\xEA nh\u01B0 \u0111\xE3
      n\u1EAFm ch\u1EAFc ph\u1EA7n th\u1EAFng. Tr\xEAn t\u01B0\u1EDDng th\xE0nh,
      binh s\u0129 Hoa L\u01B0 n\xEDn l\u1EB7ng, ch\u1EC9 c\xF2n nghe nh\u1ECBp th\u1EDF
      d\u1ED3n d\u1EADp trong b\xF3ng t\u1ED1i. C\xE1nh c\u1ED5ng g\u1ED7 kh\u1ED5ng
      l\u1ED3 r\xEDt k\u1EBDo k\u1EB9t, t\u1EEBng t\u1EA5c m\u1ED9t nh\u01B0 m\u1EDF
      ra s\u1ED1 ph\u1EADn."
    - "C\u1ED5ng th\xE0nh kh\u1EBD m\u1EDF, qu\xE2n Ng\xF4 h\xF2 reo tr\xE0n v\xE0o
      nh\u01B0 th\xE1c. Nh\u01B0ng ngay khi v\u1EEBa v\u01B0\u1EE3t qua, ti\u1EBFng
      t\xF9 v\xE0 ch\u1EA5n \u0111\u1ED9ng n\xFAi r\u1EEBng. T\xEAn l\u1EEDa v\xFAt
      s\xE1ng, k\u1EF5 binh lao xu\u1ED1ng t\u1EEB v\xE1ch \u0111\xE1. \u0110inh
      \u0110i\u1EC1n ph\xF3ng ng\u1EF1a, ch\xE9m \u0111\u1EE9t d\xE2y tr\xF3i, b\u1EBF
      Li\u1EC5n r\u1EDDi kh\u1ECFi s\xE0o tre. Gi\u1EEFa kh\xF3i l\u1EEDa, \xF4ng
      qu\u1EF3 g\u1ED1i d\xE2ng Li\u1EC5n, m\xE1u v\xE0 b\u1EE5i v\u1EA5y \u0111\u1EA7y
      gi\xE1p:"
